{"id": "649300cd-a2fe-4eaa-a0e5-b8e7f3ce490c", "slug": "quantum-data-synchronization", "title": "Quantum Data Synchronization", "description": "Quantum Data Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Quantum Data Synchronization\"\ndescription: \"Quantum Data Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4ADE80\"\n  secondary: \"#0B0E14\"\n  accent: \"#4ADE80\"\n  background: \"#0B0E14\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"31px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Quantum Data Synchronization\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 8; favorites: 6; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nQuantum Data Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNode Alpha Syncing Throughput 1.2 TB/s System Admin Deployment successful Quantum Network Active Unify your data streams at light speed. Harness the power of real-time geometric routing to aggregate, process, and deploy…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Unify your data streams at light speed..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #4ADE80, secondary #0B0E14, accent #4ADE80, background #0B0E14, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Quantum Data Synchronization</title>\n\n    <!-- Dependencies -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Typography Setup -->\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#0b0e14] text-white selection:bg-green-500/30\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Main Section Container -->\n    <section class=\"relative min-h-screen w-full flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden py-24\">\n\n        <!-- Ambient Background Image (Aura Asset) -->\n        <div class=\"ambient-bg absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat opacity-30 mix-blend-screen\"\n             style=\"background-image: url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/fa51902b-c2a4-4c33-a96e-a8f1ef67edc6_3840w.jpg');\">\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Background Gradient Overlays -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0b0e14] via-[#0b0e14]/50 to-[#0b0e14]/90 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0b0e14] via-transparent to-[#0b0e14] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Ambient Glowing Orbs -->\n        <div class=\"ambient-orb-1 absolute top-[10%] left-[15%] w-96 h-96 bg-green-500/20 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n        <div class=\"ambient-orb-2 absolute bottom-[10%] right-[15%] w-[40rem] h-[40rem] bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Floating UI Element 1 (Left) -->\n        <div class=\"floating-card-1 absolute top-[20%] left-[8%] z-20 hidden xl:flex flex-col gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-md w-64 shadow-2xl\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-green-400 to-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(74,222,128,0.3)]\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" class=\"text-white text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white/90\">Node Alpha</span>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-green-400 font-mono\">Syncing</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"space-y-2 mt-2\">\n                <div class=\"h-1 w-full bg-white/10 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"sync-bar-1 h-full w-0 bg-green-400 rounded-full\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-white/40\">\n                    <span>Throughput</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-mono text-white/60\">1.2 TB/s</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Floating UI Element 2 (Right) -->\n        <div class=\"floating-card-2 absolute bottom-[25%] right-[8%] z-20 hidden xl:flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl\">\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/0d868fef-f560-45ca-ab35-5dad4fc29059_3840w.webp\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-white/10\" />\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full border-2 border-[#0b0e14]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">System Admin</p>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-white/50\">Deployment successful</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-green-500/10 flex items-center justify-center ml-2\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-green-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Central Content Container -->\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-5xl px-6 flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n\n            <!-- Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n            <div class=\"main-card-wrapper relative rounded-[2rem] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 via-white/5 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_100px_-20px_rgba(74,222,128,0.15)] w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n\n                <!-- Inner Glass Card -->\n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#0b0e14]/60 backdrop-blur-2xl rounded-[31px] p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 border border-white/[0.02] overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n                    <!-- Top Glowing Accent Line -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[80%] h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-green-400/50 to-transparent\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"glow-accent absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[40%] h-12 bg-green-500/20 blur-[40px] rounded-full\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Badge -->\n                    <div class=\"stagger-el inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs text-white/80 mb-8 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                        <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(74,222,128,0.8)] pulse-dot\"></span>\n                        Quantum Network Active\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Main Typography -->\n                    <h1 class=\"stagger-el text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-[1.1] max-w-3xl\">\n                        Unify your data streams <br class=\"hidden sm:block\" />\n                        <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-green-300 via-emerald-400 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">at light speed.</span>\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <p class=\"stagger-el text-base md:text-lg text-white/50 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                        Harness the power of real-time geometric routing to aggregate, process, and deploy complex data structures across global nodes instantly.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <!-- CTAs -->\n                    <div class=\"stagger-el flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto\">\n                        <button class=\"relative group w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-black font-medium text-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-95 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                                Start Building\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </span>\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-green-100 to-white opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white font-medium text-sm backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/10 active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                            View Demo\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bottom subtle indicator -->\n                    <div class=\"stagger-el mt-12 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-white/30 font-medium\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\"></iconify-icon> Enterprise Grade\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-white/20\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\"></iconify-icon> Zero Latency\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- GSAP Animations -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin();\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline();\n\n            // 1. Initial Entrance Sequence\n            tl.fromTo(\".main-card-wrapper\",\n                { y: 80, opacity: 0, scale: 0.95, rotationX: 5 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, scale: 1, rotationX: 0, duration: 1.4, ease: \"power3.out\" }\n            )\n            .fromTo(\".stagger-el\",\n                { y: 30, opacity: 0 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, stagger: 0.15, duration: 0.9, ease: \"power2.out\" },\n                \"-=0.8\"\n            )\n            .fromTo([\".floating-card-1\", \".floating-card-2\"],\n                { y: 40, opacity: 0, scale: 0.9 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, scale: 1, duration: 1, stagger: 0.2, ease: \"back.out(1.2)\" },\n                \"-=0.6\"\n            );\n\n            // 2. Ambient Background Motion (Slow pan and scale)\n            gsap.to(\".ambient-bg\", {\n                scale: 1.15,\n                x: \"-2%\",\n                y: \"2%\",\n                rotation: 1,\n                duration: 25,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            // 3. Complex Ambient Motion for UI Elements\n\n            // Left Card: Tilt, subtle vertical float, and progress bar animation\n            gsap.to(\".floating-card-1\", {\n                y: -15,\n                rotationZ: -2,\n                rotationX: 5,\n                duration: 4,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            gsap.to(\".sync-bar-1\", {\n                width: \"85%\",\n                duration: 2,\n                delay: 1.5,\n                ease: \"power2.out\"\n            });\n\n            // Right Card: Horizontal drift and slight scale\n            gsap.to(\".floating-card-2\", {\n                x: 15,\n                y: -5,\n                scale: 1.02,\n                rotationZ: 1,\n                duration: 5,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"power1.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            // 4. Ambient Orbs (Figure-8/Wandering paths)\n            gsap.to(\".ambient-orb-1\", {\n                x: 120,\n                y: 60,\n                scale: 1.2,\n                opacity: 0.4,\n                duration: 8,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"power1.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            gsap.to(\".ambient-orb-2\", {\n                x: -100,\n                y: -80,\n                scale: 0.8,\n                opacity: 0.2,\n                duration: 12,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            // 5. Micro-interactions / Accent pulsing\n            gsap.to(\".pulse-dot\", {\n                opacity: 0.4,\n                scale: 0.8,\n                duration: 1,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            gsap.to(\".glow-accent\", {\n                scaleX: 1.3,\n                opacity: 0.5,\n                duration: 3,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "quantum-data-synchronization.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/quantum-data-synchronization.jpg", "source_name": "quantum-data-synchronization-DESIGN.md", "views": 81, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:45:43.730477+00:00"}